<InfoPage title="About the ClothOff AI Safe Guide" kicker="About this resource" description="An independent, consent-first educational resource about ClothOff AI searches, image privacy, virtual try-on, and responsible AI fashion editing.">
  <h2>Our purpose</h2>
  <p>ClothOff AI Safe Guide helps adults understand the privacy and consent risks around synthetic undressing tools and find safer ways to explore fashion ideas. The site does not accept image uploads, generate intimate imagery, or operate a clothing-removal service.</p>
  <h2>What we cover</h2>
  <p>Our editorial focus includes ClothOff AI safety, AI clothing remover risks, image retention and deletion questions, AI virtual try-on, AI outfit changers, fashion visualization, and consent-first photo editing.</p>
  <h2>Who writes and reviews the guides</h2>
  <p>Content is prepared by the ClothOff AI Safe Guide editorial team. Every article is reviewed for clear scope, visible safety boundaries, original comparison criteria, readable sourcing, and consistency between on-page claims and structured data.</p>
  <h2>Independence and limitations</h2>
  <p>This website is an independent educational publication. It is not a substitute for legal advice, a privacy audit, or a guarantee that a third-party AI service is safe. Tool policies and product behavior can change, so readers should verify current terms directly before uploading any image.</p>
